.TH DANBY-MAGNETICPENDULUM3D 1
.SH NAME
danby-magneticpendulum3d \- simulate a three-dimensional magnetic pendulum
.SH DESCRIPTION
A suspended bob moves in x, y, and height over four magnets.  The left view is
an oblique orthographic projection; the plot shows horizontal radius and height.
Attraction uses softened inverse-cube distance to remain finite near a magnet.
.PP
Click a parameter scale to change it, space pauses, period steps, R resets, and Q exits.
